{"about_the_game":"<strong>Demo Version Content<br>Progress: Up to the end of the Prologue.<br>Monsters: Only the monster arm from the main story and Santo.<br>Staff: Initial 2 people (Bob, George), can later recruit 2 more (Joe, Visual).<br>Company: Can hire and upgrade staff, buy/sell materials.<br>Gameplay: Includes main gameplay, but\u73a9\u6cd5 beyond decomposition need to be experienced in the &quot;Capital Monster&quot; mode.<br><br>&quot;Capital Monster&quot; mode includes:<br>Robot Factory: Preview and customize your own robot. Purchase or upgrade robot parts to enhance combat strength. Don't forget repairs to maintain optimal condition.<br>Monster Battles: Dispatch robots to battle monsters. Use different parts and skill combinations against different monsters for efficient victories.<br>Museum: Display decomposed trophies to attract visitors and earn ticket fees. Decorate with various items to make it more magnificent.<br>Restaurant: Cook monster materials using different techniques. Higher skills and better ingredient combinations create higher-quality dishes. Unique combinations may yield special delicacies.<br><br>Full Version<br>Progress: 5 chapters including the Prologue.<br>Monsters: 8 monsters that can be decomposed and battled.<br>Staff: Approximately 26 people (around 10 regular staff + 16 rare staff).<br>Company: Beyond the demo version, includes: Company Skills, Asset Acquisition, Achievement Display, etc.<br>Gameplay: Integrated into the story progression, unlocked gradually.</strong><br><br><strong>In a world ravaged by monsters, the Kaiju Cracking Corporation emerges.\u200b As the CEO, you will lead a professional team to process kaiju remains, obtain precious resources, and expand your business empire.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/1?t=1758789576\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/212f9ac399900610946bfd6197b4ec24.poster.avif?t=1758789576\" width=614 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/212f9ac399900610946bfd6197b4ec24.webm?t=1758789576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/212f9ac399900610946bfd6197b4ec24.mp4?t=1758789576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>After defeating monsters, organize your team to dismantle them and acquire rare materials. Develop smart dismantling strategies to maximize resource utilization.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/d32bcec601b47ce87314c9841a1f395a.webp?t=1758789576\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/5e95c722c8962adb6ef51146be8c4f5f.poster.avif?t=1758789576\" width=614 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/5e95c722c8962adb6ef51146be8c4f5f.webm?t=1758789576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/5e95c722c8962adb6ef51146be8c4f5f.mp4?t=1758789576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The game also features mech R&amp;D and upgrades, allowing you to freely customize your own mechs.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748730/extras/0e78def3856424408ddaf3079b69ebf7.webp?t=1758789576\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla